我は忘れない！
I will never forget!

87
00:10:43,865 --> 00:10:47,045
身を粉にして働いても
Even if I work myself to the bone,

88
00:10:47,965 --> 00:10:51,505
感謝されないことも……（シバシバ）
Even things that go unthanked... (Blinking)

89
00:10:52,155 --> 00:10:57,235
「自己犠牲」を受け入れても限界がもうやってくるから
Even if you accept "self-sacrifice," your limit is already approaching,

90
00:10:57,935 --> 00:11:00,595
自分を大事に愛せばいい
So you should cherish and love yourself.

91
00:11:00,945 --> 00:11:04,945
それは他人を愛すること
That is to love others as well.

92
00:11:05,685 --> 00:11:09,945
ああ 人は滅んでゆく 絶えてゆく
Ah, people perish, they fade away,

93
00:11:10,835 --> 00:11:13,395
元に戻ってゆく
Returning to what they were before.

94
00:11:13,655 --> 00:11:17,545
ああ 人は蘇ってゆく 救われてゆく
Ah, people revive, they are saved,

95
00:11:18,075 --> 00:11:21,305
君に逢えたから…… 君を愛したから
Because I met you... Because I loved you,

96
00:11:21,715 --> 00:11:25,935
君が戦うなら…… 僕も戦うから……
If you will fight... I will fight too...

97
