時を刻み忘れようとも我は離さない！
Even if time ticks away and we forget, I won't let go!

105
00:12:02,937 --> 00:12:04,787
我は忘れない！
I will never forget!

106
00:12:34,647 --> 00:12:39,717
それじゃあ今夜は、この王国のお話をしていこう。
Well then, tonight let's talk about this kingdom.

107
00:12:40,207 --> 00:12:47,897
嘘か真か、ここに記されている本は内容がコロコロと変わってしまう、不思議な本でね。
True or false, the book written here is a mysterious one whose contents change constantly.

108
00:12:44,717 --> 00:12:52,697
さて、今回はどんなお話になっているかな。
Now then, I wonder what kind of story it is this time.

109
00:13:02,887 --> 00:13:06,977
これはあるサーカスの一団が王国へ訪れ、
This is a story of a circus troupe visiting a kingdom,

110
00:13:07,747 --> 00:13:13,017
まだ未熟な座長さんが綺羅びやかなステージに包まれたお話
Where a still inexperienced ringleader was enveloped in a dazzling stage.

111
00:13:13,787 --> 00:13:20,167
ああ…これが私が望んだ夢のエンディング
Ah... this is the dream ending I wished for.

112
00:13:55,014 --> 00:13:58,484
さあ、今日も始まりました〜！ 綺羅びやかな享楽のパレード
Now then, today has begun! A dazzling, hedonistic parade,

113
00:13:58,624 --> 00:14:02,114
常識もここじゃ無関係 踊れ歌え騒け全て忘れて
Where common sense means nothing. Dance, sing, make noise, and forget everything!

114
00:14:02,334 --> 00:14:05,494
細かいことは置いておいて とりあえず身を任せてみな
Leave the trivial details aside and entrust yourself for now!

115
00:14:05,684 --> 00:14:09,244
幸福を少し分けるような饗宴 Show Time!
A banquet that shares a bit of happiness, Show Time!

116
00:14:16,014 --> 00:14:19,054
積もりづく不安や後悔 今だけはちょっと目を背けて
Accumulated anxiety and regrets—just look away for now,

117
00:14:19,054 --> 00:14:22,624
そのままじゃ楽しめないじゃん この場だけは何もかも忘れて！
You won't enjoy yourself like that; forget everything just for now!

118
00:14:23,484 --> 00:14:26,664
幾千の価値観全部 引っ括め楽しませたげる！
I'll scoop up thousands of values and let you enjoy them all!

119
00:14:26,914 --> 00:14:29,724
百鬼夜行もビックリの隊を成している
Forming a troop that would surprise even the Night Parade of One Hundred Demons.

120
00:14:29,864 --> 00:14:33,954
怪奇模した喜劇が幕開け 一目見ればたちまち虜に！？
The comedy imitating the bizarre opens its curtain; one look and you're instantly captivated?!

121
00:14:34,174 --> 00:14:37,304
どんな愛も受け入れてくれる ここだけはあなたの理想郷
Accepting any kind of love, this place alone is your utopia.

122
00:14:37,814 --> 00:14:40,684
「もう間もなく主役の登場、一時でも目を離さないで！」
"The protagonist's appearance is almost here, don't take your eyes off for a second!"

123
00:14:40,684 --> 00:14:43,564
眩いほどのステージが始まる。
A dazzling stage begins.

124
00:14:43,934 --> 00:14:47,234
華々しいスポットライトの中 目を奪うような妙技の数々
Amidst the brilliant spotlights, dazzling feats that steal your gaze,

125
00:14:47,484 --> 00:14:51,284
この空間が世界で一番 “娯楽”の名に相応しいんだ！
This space is most worthy of the name "entertainment" in the whole world!

126
00:14:51,564 --> 00:14:54,344
割ればかりの歓声と拍手で ショーは終わっていく
Amidst thunderous cheers and applause, the show comes to an end.

127
00:14:54,534 --> 00:14:57,194
まあ、これはあくまで理想の話なんですが^^;
Well, this is just an ideal story, after all...

128
00:15:13,004 --> 00:15:14,254
さて、今日も始めましょう…
Now then, let's begin today as well...

129
00:15:14,854 --> 00:15:16,154
あ〜、またやっちゃった
Ah, I messed up again.

130
00:15:16,154 --> 00:15:19,354
実際はご覧の通り、まだまだ未熟な見習いなんです；；
In reality, as you can see, I'm still just a clumsy apprentice;;

131
00:15:19,754 --> 00:15:22,454
先人に憧れて、私も！と飛び込んだものの
Though I admired my predecessors and leaped in saying, "Me too!"

132
00:15:22,954 --> 00:15:25,854
現実人はそんな簡単にうまくいかないな
Reality doesn't go so easily as planned.

133
00:15:25,954 --> 00:15:26,654
もう一回！
Once more!

134
00:15:26,754 --> 00:15:30,054
「怪奇模した喜劇が幕開け 一目見ればたちまち虜に！？」
"A bizarre-mimicking comedy raises its curtain—captivated at first sight!?"

135
00:15:30,054 --> 00:15:33,154
え？既にそれさっき見た？なら、飽き性なあなたにも【朗報】
Huh? You already saw that earlier? Then I have good news for you impatient folks!

136
00:15:33,854 --> 00:15:35,954
Q.ちょっと前の模倣をするだけ？
Q. Just mimicking what was right before?

137
00:15:35,954 --> 00:15:39,254
A.繰り返しじゃつまらない！だから、ここから先は趣向を変えてみよう！
A. Repetition is boring! So from here on out, let's change things up!

138
00:16:08,904 --> 00:16:12,154
ドタバタなサーカスの行方は
Where is this slapstick circus headed?

139
00:16:10,154 --> 00:16:15,354
誰にも自分すらも分からない！？私を選んだ君だけでも楽しんでってよ〜〜！！！
Not even to anyone, not even to myself!? Enjoy it even if you chose me~~~!!!

140
