00:58:34,544 --> 00:58:37,804
Sweety! Sweety! おぼろに狂えるキャンディー
Sweety! Sweety! Candy that drives you vaguely mad,

588
00:58:37,804 --> 00:58:41,124
ラッタッタ ラッタッタ ああ、もっと頂戴！
Rattatta rattatta, oh, give me more!

589
00:58:42,744 --> 00:58:48,624
泡沫の夢 淡い霧の中溶けて ああ 白い頬を涙が伝った
Melting in the fleeting dream and pale mist, Ah, tears traced down white cheeks.

590
00:58:54,444 --> 00:59:04,444
この娘は誰の為？ 呪文呪いとものすまき 禁断の扉を開けたら
Who is this girl for? Spells and curses rolled up, when I opened the forbidden door.

591
00:59:05,744 --> 00:59:07,224
時間を戻す
Turn back time,

592
00:59:07,224 --> 00:59:10,924
魔法使いちゃおかな？
Shall I use magic?

593
00:59:13,624 --> 00:59:16,724
Dancing! Dancing! 闇夜にハッピーなメロディー
Dancing! Dancing! A happy melody in the dark night,

594
00:59:16,724 --> 00:59:19,944
ラッタッタ ラッタッタ 冥界Halloween Night!
Rattatta rattatta, Underworld Halloween Night!

595
00:59:20,304 --> 00:59:23,624
Swinging! Swinging! ゾッとして愉快なアイロニー
Swinging! Swinging! Thrilling and delightful irony,

596
00:59:23,624 --> 00:59:26,684
ラッタッタ ラッタッタ 狂宴のショータイム！
Rattatta rattatta, banquet showtime!

597
00:59:26,944 --> 00:59:28,304
(Pe Pe Pa) 恐ろしいや
(Pe Pe Pa) How terrifying,

598
00:59:28,304 --> 00:59:32,804
(Pu Pu Pa) 悪戯や 見い出の身の上のさいも忘れてる
(Pu Pu Pa) Mischief, even forgetting your own fate.

599
00:59:32,804 --> 00:59:35,824
おろろ？ (Pe Pe Pa) 美味しそうな (Pu Pu Pa) 魂じゃん！
Oh my? (Pe Pe Pa) Such delicious (Pu Pu Pa) souls!

600
00:59:36,404 --> 00:59:37,684
Welcome! さあ踊ろうよ
Welcome! Now let's dance,

601
00:59:37,684 --> 00:59:39,084
This is Halloween Night!

602
01:00:02,229 --> 01:00:05,149
ハロウィンパーティー、いかがでしたでしょうか？
How did you enjoy the Halloween party?

603
01:00:05,429 --> 01:00:08,609
ちゃんとこちら側の王国に戻ってこられてますか？
Have you made it safely back to our kingdom?

604
01:00:08,949 --> 01:00:16,329
冥界の女王様にお気に召されてしまうと魂を奪われてしまって帰って来られませんからね。
If the queen of the underworld takes a liking to you, she'll steal your soul and you won't be able to come back.

605
01:00:16,589 --> 01:00:20,609
戻ってこられてラッキーでした、なんて。
Aren't you lucky you managed to return?

606
01:00:22,089 --> 01:00:25,929
今日のお話はどうでしたか？楽しかったでしょうか？
How was today's story? Did you enjoy it?

607
01:00:26,209 --> 01:00:30,549
私が特にお気に入りは探偵のお話でした。
My personal favorite was the detective story.

608
01:00:30,789 --> 01:00:33,649
今回お聞かせできてとても嬉しかったです。
I'm so glad I got to share it with you this time.

609
01:00:34,209 --> 01:00:38,129
そうだ、いつかあなたのお話も聞かせてくださいね。
Oh right, please let me hear your story sometime too.

610
01:00:38,669 --> 01:00:43,729
もしかするとあなたのお話も書き記されるかもしれませんよ。
Who knows, your story might even be written down here.

611
01:00:44,189 --> 01:00:48,529
なんと言っても、まか不思議な本ですから。
After all, it's a wondrous and mysterious book.

612
01:00:48,909 --> 01:00:53,389
何が起こるか、司書である私にも分かりません。
Even as the librarian, I have no idea what will happen.

613
01:00:53,949 --> 01:00:57,469
さて、そろそろお時間ですね。
Well, it's almost time.

614
01:00:57,729 --> 01:01:04,449
またお話が聞きたくなりましたら、いつでもこの王国図書館へお越しください。
If you ever want to hear another story again, please come visit this kingdom library anytime.

615
01:01:04,929 --> 01:01:07,809
それでは、さようなら。
Until then, farewell.

616
01:01:19,456 --> 01:01:22,246
ハジマリはきっと一つの願い
Every beginning is surely a single wish,

617
01:01:22,246 --> 01:01:27,706
それを抱いて私たちは生まれた 孤独な夜空 震える指で 点と点をつなげよう
we were born holding it. In the lonely night sky, with trembling fingers, let's connect the dots.

618
01:01:27,706 --> 01:01:32,126
（woh oh woh oh woh oh oh oh）
(Woh-oh-oh-oh-oh-oh-oh-oh)

619
01:01:42,477 --> 01:01:44,957
ライブに来た皆さん！準備はできてますか？
Everyone here at the live, are you ready?

620
01:01:45,217 --> 01:01:47,617
セイ！ハロー！行きますよ！
Say! Hello! Here we go!

621
01:01:47,617 --> 01:01:50,227
せい！ ほら どの子も顔上げて
Hey! Look, everyone raise your faces up,

622
01:01:50,227 --> 01:01:53,217
みんなで手を取れば 最強！
if we all hold hands, it's the strongest!

623
01:01:53,217 --> 01:01:57,597
まだまだ道途中 世界を超えよう
Still on the way, let's transcend the world!

624
01:01:58,597 --> 01:02:04,197
ほら 押し押し稼働 止まらない独占欲ですから
Push ahead without stopping, because of our unstoppable desire!

625
01:02:04,197 --> 01:02:08,347
夢を書き換えたら 追いかけ続けよう
Once you rewrite your dream, keep chasing after it!

626
01:02:08,347 --> 01:02:12,947
ともに繋ぐ ファンファーレ GO!
A fanfare connecting us together, GO!

627
01:02:18,087 --> 01:02:20,657
だから君がいつか 自分自身の
So whenever you happen to lose sight

628
01:02:20,657 --> 01:02:27,057
輝きを見失ったときには 思い出してね ぼくらの聖夜は君がいるから輝く
of your own brilliance, remember: our holy night shines because you are here!

629
01:02:42,527 --> 01:02:46,507
眠る星の中 光が君がくれた
Amidst sleeping stars, the light you gave me

630
01:02:46,507 --> 01:02:52,547
スーパーノヴァ起こせ今 何度だって飛び立てる
Supernova, trigger it now, we can take flight no matter how many times!

631
01:02:52,547 --> 01:02:56,547
これは紛れもなく僕らの奇跡 High Five!
This is unquestionably our miracle, High Five!

632
01:02:56,547 --> 01:03:01,867
超えて行けるさ スーパーノヴァ起こせ今 何度だって飛び立てる
We can surpass it, supernova trigger it now, we can take flight no matter how many times!

633
01:03:01,867 --> 01:03:06,347
これは紛れもなく僕らの奇跡 High Five!
This is unquestionably our miracle, High Five!

